    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Docker Content Trust 退休，镜像签名需要迁移",
      "summary": "Docker 宣布 Content Trust 退休并给出迁移指引。DCT 与 Notary v1 曾是 Docker 镜像签名的主要入口，退休意味着依赖 DOCKER_CONTENT_TRUST、旧签名策略和私有 registry 验证路径的团队必须换路。这会牵动 CI/CD、镜像发布、准入控制和合规文档。维护内部 registry 的团队应先盘点依赖，再评估 cosign、Notation 和 Kubernetes 准入策略。",
      "url": "https://www.docker.com/blog/docker-content-trust-retirement-and-migration-guidance/",
      "author": "Docker",
      "source": "Docker 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-16",
      "image": "https://www.docker.com/app/uploads/2025/03/image.png",
      "domain": "infra",
      "tags": [
        "容器",
        "镜像签名",
        "供应链"
      ],
      "position": 5
